WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.790
Maya Bay, on the uninhabited
island of Phi Phi Leh, in Thailand.

2
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:08.350
It became famous after it
featured in the film The Beach.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.630
Then, in June 2018, it closed.

4
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.470
Reopening was planned for 1 January 2022.

5
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.050
To shoot a film?

6
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.830
Sold to a private resort?

7
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.230
Why would a country shut a
beach that tourists love?

8
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.930
In this mission, you'll trace
Butler's model of how a resort grows,

9
00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:30.210
stagnates, and then
declines or is rejuvenated.

10
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.750
Then you'll go to Venice, and
compare ways to manage a hotspot,

11
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.490
from an access fee to set routes.

12
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:41.480
Your mission: explain why Thailand
closed one of its most famous beaches.
